C('annuity','fin','Annuity Calculator','Future value of regular payments.',[N('c','Payment each period',500),N('r','Rate per year (%)',5),N('y','Years',15),S('n','Payments per year',['12','4','2','1']),S('t','Payment made',[['0','At the end of each period'],['1','At the start of each period']])],v=>{const n=+v.n,r=v.r/100/n,k=Math.round(v.y*n);let fv=r?v.c*(Math.pow(1+r,k)-1)/r:v.c*k;if(+v.t)fv*=1+r;return[['Future value',cN(fv),'big'],['Total paid in',cN(v.c*k)],['Interest earned',cN(fv-v.c*k)]]});
C('annuity-payout','fin','Annuity Payout Calculator','Regular income from a lump sum.',[N('b','Lump sum',200000),N('r','Rate per year (%)',4),N('y','Years of payments',20),S('n','Payments per year',['12','4','2','1'])],v=>{const n=+v.n,k=Math.round(v.y*n),p=cpmt(v.b,v.r/100/n,k);return[['Payment each period',cN(p),'big'],['Total received',cN(p*k)],['Interest portion',cN(p*k-v.b)]]});
C('debt-payoff','fin','Debt Payoff Calculator','Time and interest to clear a debt with a fixed payment.',[N('b','Balance',8000),N('r','Interest rate per year (%)',18),N('p','Monthly payment',300)],v=>{const r=v.r/1200;cNeed(v.p>v.b*r,'The payment must be higher than the monthly interest ('+cN(v.b*r)+').');const n=r?-Math.log(1-v.b*r/v.p)/Math.log(1+r):v.b/v.p;return[['Time to pay off',cYM(Math.ceil(n)),'big'],['Total interest',cN(v.p*n-v.b)],['Total paid',cN(v.p*n)]]});
C('credit-card','fin','Credit Card Calculator','How long a card balance takes to clear.',[N('b','Balance',5000),N('r','Interest rate (APR %)',22),N('p','Monthly payment',200)],v=>{const r=v.r/1200;cNeed(v.p>v.b*r,'The payment must be higher than the monthly interest ('+cN(v.b*r)+').');const n=r?-Math.log(1-v.b*r/v.p)/Math.log(1+r):v.b/v.p;return[['Time to pay off',cYM(Math.ceil(n)),'big'],['Total interest',cN(v.p*n-v.b)],['Total paid',cN(v.p*n)]]});
C('credit-cards-payoff','fin','Credit Cards Payoff Calculator','Monthly payment needed to be debt-free by a date.',[N('b','Balance',5000),N('r','Interest rate (APR %)',22),N('m','Months to pay off',24)],v=>{const p=cpmt(v.b,v.r/1200,Math.round(v.m));return[['Monthly payment needed',cN(p),'big'],['Total interest',cN(p*Math.round(v.m)-v.b)],['Total paid',cN(p*Math.round(v.m))]]});
C('dti','fin','Debt-to-Income Ratio Calculator','How lenders compare your debts with your income.',[N('i','Gross monthly income',5000),N('h','Housing payment per month',1200),N('d','Other debt payments per month',400)],v=>{cNeed(v.i>0,'Income must be above zero.');const f=v.h/v.i*100,b=(v.h+v.d)/v.i*100;return[['Back-end ratio (all debts)',cP(b),'big'],['Front-end ratio (housing)',cP(f)],['Guide',b<=36?'Within the common 36% guideline':b<=43?'Above 36%; many lenders still allow up to 43%':'High; borrowing may be hard']]});
